{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0c7a4699f1456f3e","type":"text","text":"What point is this in Caide’s life?","x":-277,"y":-365,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"8c9a5971333b37eb","x":-580,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":144,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"He’s an active member of the Disavowed, hunting the last rogue Sages he can find."},
		{"id":"ec8844ccb5886aef","x":-580,"y":20,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"He’s a bum."},
		{"id":"7af767c153290291","x":-277,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":230,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"He “works” as a bodyguard for Dan. Primary duties include: standing around behind Dan, look intimidating, and at times provide mundane conversation.\n\n"},
		{"id":"ab25ffe1491d521c","x":-277,"y":120,"width":250,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"Hira tells him about a possible arm, but it costs a fortune."},
		{"id":"77b90632b9412369","x":-277,"y":300,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"What does Caide do?"}
	],
